ScepterClass: {
	DisplayName: Scepter Damage
	Summary:
		'''
		All Scepters have two functions.
		The primary fire is typically a projectile sourced from the centerpiece topping one end of the scepter.
		The secondary fire throws the scepter itself at an enemy. Which is guaranteed to deal at least 50% more knockback than the primary fire.

		The two functions are expanded on by usage of the following:
		- Scrolls: Add on to existing attacks, typically by firing extra projectiles.
		- Gloves: Almost exclusively related to throw speed and range.
		- Pendants: Used mostly for stat modification, but can offer imbues.
		- Bulwarks: Only one exists, and the full functonality is not implemented.
		- Vials: Flasks are shimmerable into Vials. Vials only affect thrown scepters.
		'''
}
